OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWednesday will be dry and
OL,6,Fsettled with some hot sunshine
OL,7,Fdeveloping, once early patches of low
OL,8,Fcloud and mist clear. Further cloud
OL,9,Fwill edge in from the northwest during
OL,10,Fthe day, turning the sunshine a little
OL,11,Fhazy in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere'll be some bright
OL,14,Fweather to end the day, and clear
OL,15,Fintervals this evening. However, cloud
OL,16,Fwill gradually thicken from the
OL,17,Fnorthwest overnight perhaps with a few
OL,18,Fshowers breaking out.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
