OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThursday will be a fresher
OL,6,Fday than recently. Cloud at first will
OL,7,Fbreak up to give sunny spells during
OL,8,Fthe day, although the odd light shower
OL,9,Fis also possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt looks
OL,12,Flargely dry on Friday and during the
OL,13,Fweekend. Though remaining a little
OL,14,Fcooler and fresher there will be some
OL,15,Fwarm spells of sunshine at times, with
OL,16,Fgentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
